        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat sink for CPU, network equipment, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat sink for CPU, network equipment, at plant
The data set represents the production of heat sinks for data centers; UUID: c89a5c4e-eceb-3777-8959-486a5499ecba
The dataset is based on average of three CPU heat sinks found in rack and blade servers. Copper and steel are the main components.
Location: Data for global average for CPU heat sinks
Technology: Typically heat sinks for rack and blade servers
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c89a5c4e-eceb-3777-8959-486a5499ecba.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
